window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b289-407f45129e91a0e9.json"]={sha256:"407f45129e91a0e9da5e2f17f3b3af84de58d2c55737da8df9ac446ad4bc137c",value:{"id":"b289","title":"大型港口沉箱碼頭","titleEn":"Large-port caisson quay walls","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"將回填土水壓船舶作用與地基變形連成沉箱碼頭受力路徑。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Trace caisson-quay load paths through backfill, water, vessels and foundation deformation. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-port","architectureNodes":[["主動土壓假設","Active earth-pressure assumptions"],["碼頭堆載側壓","Quay surcharge lateral action"],["基底偏心壓力","Eccentric base pressure"],["護舷曲線積分","Integrating fender response"],["接縫位移與止水","Joint movement and sealing"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-port","labels":["主動土壓假設","碼頭堆載側壓","基底偏心壓力","護舷曲線積分","接縫位移與止水"],"labelsEn":["Active earth-pressure assumptions","Quay surcharge lateral action","Eccentric base pressure","Integrating fender response","Joint movement and sealing"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設水平無黏性回填、光滑直立牆且已達主動狀態，φ=30°，Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333；不適用靜止狀態。假設摩擦角由30增10%至33°，其他朗肯條件不變，Ka由0.3333降為0.2948，約減11.56%；不能推論整座碼頭風險同比下降。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume level cohesionless fill, a smooth vertical wall and mobilized active conditions. Atφ=30°,Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333, not at-rest pressure. Increasing friction angle10% from30°to33° under unchanged Rankine assumptions reduces Ka from0.3333 to0.2948, approximately11.56%, without an equivalent reduction in whole-quay risk. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b289-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「主動土壓假設」與「有效土壓積分」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Active earth-pressure assumptions\" and \"Effective earth-pressure integration\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b289-v15-01","title":"主動土壓假設：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Active earth-pressure assumptions: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「主動土壓假設」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Active earth-pressure assumptions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"碼頭背填土會把側向作用傳入沉箱，但是否達到主動狀態取決於牆體位移及土體條件。簡單朗肯係數假設水平無黏性回填與光滑直立牆，與靜止土壓不同；港區受限位移、分層或密實施工時，不能僅憑摩擦角選一個較小係數。 假設水平無黏性回填、光滑直立牆且已達主動狀態，φ=30°，Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333；不適用靜止狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「主動土壓假設」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Backfill transfers lateral action into a caisson, but mobilizing an active state requires compatible wall movement and soil conditions. The simple Rankine coefficient assumes level cohesionless backfill and a smooth vertical wall, distinct from at-rest pressure. Restricted deformation, layering or compaction means friction angle alone cannot justify selecting the smaller coefficient for every quay-wall condition. Assume level cohesionless fill, a smooth vertical wall and mobilized active conditions. Atφ=30°,Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333, not at-rest pressure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Active earth-pressure assumptions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「主動土壓假設」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Active earth-pressure assumptions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-01-k1","title":"主動土壓假設","titleEn":"Active earth-pressure assumptions","text":"碼頭背填土會把側向作用傳入沉箱，但是否達到主動狀態取決於牆體位移及土體條件。簡單朗肯係數假設水平無黏性回填與光滑直立牆，與靜止土壓不同；港區受限位移、分層或密實施工時，不能僅憑摩擦角選一個較小係數。","textEn":"Backfill transfers lateral action into a caisson, but mobilizing an active state requires compatible wall movement and soil conditions. The simple Rankine coefficient assumes level cohesionless backfill and a smooth vertical wall, distinct from at-rest pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「主動土壓假設」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Active earth-pressure assumptions\" is correct?","options":["所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。","碼頭背填土會把側向作用傳入沉箱，但是否達到主動狀態取決於牆體位移及土體條件。","使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。"],"optionsEn":["Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement.","Backfill transfers lateral action into a caisson, but mobilizing an active state requires compatible wall movement and soil conditions.","Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"碼頭背填土會把側向作用傳入沉箱，但是否達到主動狀態取決於牆體位移及土體條件。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Backfill transfers lateral action into a caisson, but mobilizing an active state requires compatible wall movement and soil conditions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b289-v15-02","title":"主動土壓假設：定量估算","titleEn":"Active earth-pressure assumptions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「主動土壓假設」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Active earth-pressure assumptions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設水平無黏性回填、光滑直立牆且已達主動狀態，φ=30°，Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333；不適用靜止狀態。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume level cohesionless fill, a smooth vertical wall and mobilized active conditions. Atφ=30°,Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333, not at-rest pressure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設水平無黏性回填、光滑直立牆且已達主動狀態，φ=30°，Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333；不適用靜止狀態。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume level cohesionless fill, a smooth vertical wall and mobilized active conditions. Atφ=30°,Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333, not at-rest pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「主動土壓假設」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Active earth-pressure assumptions\", which statement holds?","options":["回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。","靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary.","Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b289-v15-03","title":"主動土壓假設：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Active earth-pressure assumptions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「主動土壓假設」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Active earth-pressure assumptions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。分開檢查施工壓密與服務期約束，用土樣與位移紀錄確認參數，不以單一公式取代狀態辨識。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state. Review compaction and service constraints separately and use soil and displacement records to justify parameters rather than substituting one formula for identification of the stress state. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。分開檢查施工壓密與服務期約束，用土樣與位移紀錄確認參數，不以單一公式取代狀態辨識。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state. Review compaction and service constraints separately and use soil and displacement records to justify parameters rather than substituting one formula for identification of the stress state.","failure":"注意干擾：剛性受限牆體未達主動位移卻採主動係數會低估側壓，黏性回填或坡面改變也使假設失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using active pressure for a restrained wall understates lateral action, and cohesive fill or altered slopes violate the assumptions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。分開檢查施工壓密與服務期約束，用土樣與位移紀錄確認參數，不以單一公式取代狀態辨識。","textEn":"Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state. Review compaction and service constraints separately and use soil and displacement records to justify parameters rather than substituting one formula for identification of the stress state.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。分開檢查施工壓密與服務期約束，用土樣與位移紀錄確認參數，不以單一公式取代狀態辨識。","textEn":"Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state. Review compaction and service constraints separately and use soil and displacement records to justify parameters rather than substituting one formula for identification of the stress state.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「主動土壓假設」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Active earth-pressure assumptions\"?","options":["畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。"],"optionsEn":["Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫出背填坡面、牆背摩擦與可能位移方向，核對使用主動狀態是否有足夠變形依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw backfill geometry, wall interface and possible movement, checking evidence for mobilizing the active state. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b289-v15-04","title":"主動土壓假設：失效診斷","titleEn":"Active earth-pressure assumptions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「主動土壓假設」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Active earth-pressure assumptions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"剛性受限牆體未達主動位移卻採主動係數會低估側壓，黏性回填或坡面改變也使假設失效。施工時壓密設備可能留下高於單純自重理論的壓力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using active pressure for a restrained wall understates lateral action, and cohesive fill or altered slopes violate the assumptions. Compaction equipment may also leave pressures greater than predicted by a simple self-weight active model. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設水平無黏性回填、光滑直立牆且已達主動狀態，φ=30°，Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333；不適用靜止狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Atφ=30°,Ka=tan²(45°−φ/2)=0.3333, not at-rest pressure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"剛性受限牆體未達主動位移卻採主動係數會低估側壓，黏性回填或坡面改變也使假設失效。施工時壓密設備可能留下高於單純自重理論的壓力。","textEn":"Using active pressure for a restrained wall understates lateral action, and cohesive fill or altered slopes violate the assumptions. Compaction equipment may also leave pressures greater than predicted by a simple self-weight active model.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「主動土壓假設」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Active earth-pressure assumptions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","剛性受限牆體未達主動位移卻採主動係數會低估側壓，黏性回填或坡面改變也使假設失效。","使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Using active pressure for a restrained wall understates lateral action, and cohesive fill or altered slopes violate the assumptions.","Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"剛性受限牆體未達主動位移卻採主動係數會低估側壓，黏性回填或坡面改變也使假設失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using active pressure for a restrained wall understates lateral action, and cohesive fill or altered slopes violate the assumptions. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b289-v15-05","title":"有效土壓積分：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Effective earth-pressure integration: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「有效土壓積分」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Effective earth-pressure integration” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"水下回填的土骨架壓力與孔隙水壓必須分開，使用浮重度積分的是有效土壓而不是總側壓。深度線性分布只涵蓋均質填料自重，分層和地面堆載另列；將孔壓漏掉或重複計入都會破壞沉箱整體平衡與作用點判讀。 假設Ka=1/3、浮重度10kN/m³、高H=15m，Pa=Kaγ′H²/2=375kN/m，作用在底上5m；水壓另算。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「有效土壓積分」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Effective skeleton pressure in submerged fill must be separated from pore pressure. Integration with submerged unit weight gives effective soil action, not total lateral action. A linear distribution covers homogeneous self-weight only; layers and surcharges require separate terms. Omitting or double-counting water pressure corrupts both caisson equilibrium and interpretation of the resultant location along the wall. Assume Ka=1/3,submerged unit weight10kN/m³ and H=15m. Pa=375kN/m acts5m above base; pore-water pressure is separate. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Effective earth-pressure integration” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「有效土壓積分」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Effective earth-pressure integration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-05-k1","title":"有效土壓積分","titleEn":"Effective earth-pressure integration","text":"水下回填的土骨架壓力與孔隙水壓必須分開，使用浮重度積分的是有效土壓而不是總側壓。深度線性分布只涵蓋均質填料自重，分層和地面堆載另列；將孔壓漏掉或重複計入都會破壞沉箱整體平衡與作用點判讀。","textEn":"Effective skeleton pressure in submerged fill must be separated from pore pressure. Integration with submerged unit weight gives effective soil action, not total lateral action.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「有效土壓積分」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Effective earth-pressure integration\" is correct?","options":["使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。","全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。","水下回填的土骨架壓力與孔隙水壓必須分開，使用浮重度積分的是有效土壓而不是總側壓。"],"optionsEn":["Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure.","The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.","Effective skeleton pressure in submerged fill must be separated from pore pressure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"水下回填的土骨架壓力與孔隙水壓必須分開，使用浮重度積分的是有效土壓而不是總側壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Effective skeleton pressure in submerged fill must be separated from pore pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b289-v15-06","title":"有效土壓積分：定量估算","titleEn":"Effective earth-pressure integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「有效土壓積分」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Effective earth-pressure integration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Ka=1/3、浮重度10kN/m³、高H=15m，Pa=Kaγ′H²/2=375kN/m，作用在底上5m；水壓另算。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume Ka=1/3,submerged unit weight10kN/m³ and H=15m. Pa=375kN/m acts5m above base; pore-water pressure is separate. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Ka=1/3、浮重度10kN/m³、高H=15m，Pa=Kaγ′H²/2=375kN/m，作用在底上5m；水壓另算。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume Ka=1/3,submerged unit weight10kN/m³ and H=15m. Pa=375kN/m acts5m above base; pore-water pressure is separate.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「有效土壓積分」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Effective earth-pressure integration\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。","護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory.","All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b289-v15-07","title":"有效土壓積分：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Effective earth-pressure integration: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「有效土壓積分」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective earth-pressure integration” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。核對浮重度來源，將船舶、堆載及地震作用分開，避免相同水壓被不同表格重複加入。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment. Verify submerged unit weight and keep vessel, surcharge and seismic terms separate so the same water action is not added twice in different tables. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。核對浮重度來源，將船舶、堆載及地震作用分開，避免相同水壓被不同表格重複加入。","observationEn":"Site practice: Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment. Verify submerged unit weight and keep vessel, surcharge and seismic terms separate so the same water action is not added twice in different tables.","failure":"注意干擾：以飽和重度積分後又加完整水壓可能高估作用，僅用浮重度卻不加水壓則低估。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using saturated unit weight and then adding full water pressure can overcount action, while submerged weight alone omits water. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。核對浮重度來源，將船舶、堆載及地震作用分開，避免相同水壓被不同表格重複加入。","textEn":"Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment. Verify submerged unit weight and keep vessel, surcharge and seismic terms separate so the same water action is not added twice in different tables.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。核對浮重度來源，將船舶、堆載及地震作用分開，避免相同水壓被不同表格重複加入。","textEn":"Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment. Verify submerged unit weight and keep vessel, surcharge and seismic terms separate so the same water action is not added twice in different tables.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「有效土壓積分」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Effective earth-pressure integration\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。","全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment.","Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort."],"answer":1,"explanation":"逐層畫有效土壓和水壓圖，標明水位及每個三角形的作用點，積分後重建合力與力矩。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot effective-soil and water-pressure diagrams with levels and resultant locations, then reconstruct total force and moment. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b289-v15-08","title":"有效土壓積分：失效診斷","titleEn":"Effective earth-pressure integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「有效土壓積分」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective earth-pressure integration” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以飽和重度積分後又加完整水壓可能高估作用，僅用浮重度卻不加水壓則低估。合力數值碰巧相近時，錯誤作用點仍可能使傾覆力矩嚴重偏離。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using saturated unit weight and then adding full water pressure can overcount action, while submerged weight alone omits water. Even coincidentally similar total forces can have incorrect resultant locations and materially wrong overturning moments. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設Ka=1/3、浮重度10kN/m³、高H=15m，Pa=Kaγ′H²/2=375kN/m，作用在底上5m；水壓另算。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Pa=375kN/m acts5m above base; pore-water pressure is separate.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以飽和重度積分後又加完整水壓可能高估作用，僅用浮重度卻不加水壓則低估。合力數值碰巧相近時，錯誤作用點仍可能使傾覆力矩嚴重偏離。","textEn":"Using saturated unit weight and then adding full water pressure can overcount action, while submerged weight alone omits water. Even coincidentally similar total forces can have incorrect resultant locations and materially wrong overturning moments.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「有效土壓積分」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Effective earth-pressure integration\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。","以飽和重度積分後又加完整水壓可能高估作用，僅用浮重度卻不加水壓則低估。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.","Using saturated unit weight and then adding full water pressure can overcount action, while submerged weight alone omits water."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以飽和重度積分後又加完整水壓可能高估作用，僅用浮重度卻不加水壓則低估。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using saturated unit weight and then adding full water pressure can overcount action, while submerged weight alone omits water. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b289-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「碼頭堆載側壓」與「潮差與殘留水壓」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Quay surcharge lateral action\" and \"Tidal difference and retained water\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b289-v15-09","title":"碼頭堆載側壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Quay surcharge lateral action: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「碼頭堆載側壓」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Quay surcharge lateral action” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"港區堆載的位置與範圍影響牆背側壓，無限均布面載只是簡化情境。貨櫃堆、起重機輪壓及條形基礎不能直接視為同一面載，局部作用可能沿牆長擴散；需要將工況、荷載路徑及土體假設相連，不能把一項平均值永久套用所有作業。 假設無限均布q=30kPa、Ka=1/3、牆高15m，增量側壓Ka q=10kPa、合力150kN/m；不代表局部輪載。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「碼頭堆載側壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Position and extent of terminal loading govern lateral response, with an infinite uniform surcharge only one idealization. Container stacks, crane wheels and strip foundations are different actions and can spread differently along the wall. Load cases, transfer paths and soil assumptions must be connected rather than assigning one average surcharge permanently to every possible terminal operation. Assume infinite uniform surcharge30kPa,Ka=1/3 and wall height15m. Incremental pressure is10kPa and resultant150kN/m, not a local wheel-load model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Quay surcharge lateral action” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「碼頭堆載側壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Quay surcharge lateral action”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-09-k1","title":"碼頭堆載側壓","titleEn":"Quay surcharge lateral action","text":"港區堆載的位置與範圍影響牆背側壓，無限均布面載只是簡化情境。貨櫃堆、起重機輪壓及條形基礎不能直接視為同一面載，局部作用可能沿牆長擴散；需要將工況、荷載路徑及土體假設相連，不能把一項平均值永久套用所有作業。","textEn":"Position and extent of terminal loading govern lateral response, with an infinite uniform surcharge only one idealization. Container stacks, crane wheels and strip foundations are different actions and can spread differently along the wall.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「碼頭堆載側壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Quay surcharge lateral action\" is correct?","options":["港區堆載的位置與範圍影響牆背側壓，無限均布面載只是簡化情境。","全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。","回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。"],"optionsEn":["Position and extent of terminal loading govern lateral response, with an infinite uniform surcharge only one idealization.","The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.","Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"港區堆載的位置與範圍影響牆背側壓，無限均布面載只是簡化情境。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Position and extent of terminal loading govern lateral response, with an infinite uniform surcharge only one idealization. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b289-v15-10","title":"碼頭堆載側壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Quay surcharge lateral action: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「碼頭堆載側壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Quay surcharge lateral action” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設無限均布q=30kPa、Ka=1/3、牆高15m，增量側壓Ka q=10kPa、合力150kN/m；不代表局部輪載。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume infinite uniform surcharge30kPa,Ka=1/3 and wall height15m. Incremental pressure is10kPa and resultant150kN/m, not a local wheel-load model. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設無限均布q=30kPa、Ka=1/3、牆高15m，增量側壓Ka q=10kPa、合力150kN/m；不代表局部輪載。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume infinite uniform surcharge30kPa,Ka=1/3 and wall height15m. Incremental pressure is10kPa and resultant150kN/m, not a local wheel-load model.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「碼頭堆載側壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Quay surcharge lateral action\", which statement holds?","options":["靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。"],"optionsEn":["Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b289-v15-11","title":"碼頭堆載側壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Quay surcharge lateral action: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「碼頭堆載側壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Quay surcharge lateral action” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。另畫集中與條形荷載的傳遞路徑，將實際作業組合連回允許配置，不以日平均貨量取代短期峰值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation. Trace concentrated and strip-load paths separately, linking operational combinations to reviewed layouts rather than substituting daily average cargo for short-duration peak loading conditions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。另畫集中與條形荷載的傳遞路徑，將實際作業組合連回允許配置，不以日平均貨量取代短期峰值。","observationEn":"Site practice: Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation. Trace concentrated and strip-load paths separately, linking operational combinations to reviewed layouts rather than substituting daily average cargo for short-duration peak loading conditions.","failure":"注意干擾：起重機靠牆時局部應力可能高於全場平均，倉儲配置改變又會新增未評估的荷載組合。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A crane near the edge can create stresses above the terminal average, while changed storage layouts add unreviewed combinations. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。另畫集中與條形荷載的傳遞路徑，將實際作業組合連回允許配置，不以日平均貨量取代短期峰值。","textEn":"Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation. Trace concentrated and strip-load paths separately, linking operational combinations to reviewed layouts rather than substituting daily average cargo for short-duration peak loading conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。另畫集中與條形荷載的傳遞路徑，將實際作業組合連回允許配置，不以日平均貨量取代短期峰值。","textEn":"Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation. Trace concentrated and strip-load paths separately, linking operational combinations to reviewed layouts rather than substituting daily average cargo for short-duration peak loading conditions.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「碼頭堆載側壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Quay surcharge lateral action\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。","在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head.","Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在平面圖標出堆載邊界及距牆距離，確認荷載是否可近似無限均布。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map loading limits and setback from the wall and test the infinite-uniform approximation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b289-v15-12","title":"碼頭堆載側壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Quay surcharge lateral action: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「碼頭堆載側壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Quay surcharge lateral action” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"起重機靠牆時局部應力可能高於全場平均，倉儲配置改變又會新增未評估的荷載組合。只沿用初始均布數值，容易漏掉沉箱接縫附近的集中需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A crane near the edge can create stresses above the terminal average, while changed storage layouts add unreviewed combinations. Retaining the original uniform value may miss concentrated demand near joints between adjacent quay caissons. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設無限均布q=30kPa、Ka=1/3、牆高15m，增量側壓Ka q=10kPa、合力150kN/m；不代表局部輪載。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Incremental pressure is10kPa and resultant150kN/m, not a local wheel-load model.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"起重機靠牆時局部應力可能高於全場平均，倉儲配置改變又會新增未評估的荷載組合。只沿用初始均布數值，容易漏掉沉箱接縫附近的集中需求。","textEn":"A crane near the edge can create stresses above the terminal average, while changed storage layouts add unreviewed combinations. Retaining the original uniform value may miss concentrated demand near joints between adjacent quay caissons.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「碼頭堆載側壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Quay surcharge lateral action\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["起重機靠牆時局部應力可能高於全場平均，倉儲配置改變又會新增未評估的荷載組合。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。"],"optionsEn":["A crane near the edge can create stresses above the terminal average, while changed storage layouts add unreviewed combinations.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"起重機靠牆時局部應力可能高於全場平均，倉儲配置改變又會新增未評估的荷載組合。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A crane near the edge can create stresses above the terminal average, while changed storage layouts add unreviewed combinations. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b289-v15-13","title":"潮差與殘留水壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Tidal difference and retained water: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「潮差與殘留水壓」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tidal difference and retained water” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"退潮時回填內水位可能下降較慢，沉箱兩側水壓不同步，排水能力便成為整體受力的一部分。兩側同底面靜水三角形可以分別積分後相減，但滲流、波動和排水堵塞會改變實際分布；只用海面潮位不能確定回填孔壓。 假設同底面兩側靜水深5與3m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，淨水平力γ(5²−3²)/2=80.442kN/m；不含滲流動態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「潮差與殘留水壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"During falling tide, backfill water may lag behind the harbor level, making drainage part of the overall load path. Hydrostatic triangles referenced to the same base can be integrated separately and subtracted, but seepage, waves and clogged drains alter the distribution. Sea level alone cannot establish the pore-pressure condition within the backfill during the same event. Assume hydrostatic depths5 and3m above one base and seawaterγ=10.05525kN/m³. Net horizontal force=80.442kN/m, excluding transient seepage. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Tidal difference and retained water” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「潮差與殘留水壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Tidal difference and retained water”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-13-k1","title":"潮差與殘留水壓","titleEn":"Tidal difference and retained water","text":"退潮時回填內水位可能下降較慢，沉箱兩側水壓不同步，排水能力便成為整體受力的一部分。兩側同底面靜水三角形可以分別積分後相減，但滲流、波動和排水堵塞會改變實際分布；只用海面潮位不能確定回填孔壓。","textEn":"During falling tide, backfill water may lag behind the harbor level, making drainage part of the overall load path. Hydrostatic triangles referenced to the same base can be integrated separately and subtracted, but seepage, waves and clogged drains alter the distribution.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「潮差與殘留水壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Tidal difference and retained water\" is correct?","options":["回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。","退潮時回填內水位可能下降較慢，沉箱兩側水壓不同步，排水能力便成為整體受力的一部分。","基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。"],"optionsEn":["Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary.","During falling tide, backfill water may lag behind the harbor level, making drainage part of the overall load path.","A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory."],"answer":1,"explanation":"退潮時回填內水位可能下降較慢，沉箱兩側水壓不同步，排水能力便成為整體受力的一部分。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"During falling tide, backfill water may lag behind the harbor level, making drainage part of the overall load path. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b289-v15-14","title":"潮差與殘留水壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Tidal difference and retained water: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「潮差與殘留水壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tidal difference and retained water” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同底面兩側靜水深5與3m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，淨水平力γ(5²−3²)/2=80.442kN/m；不含滲流動態。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume hydrostatic depths5 and3m above one base and seawaterγ=10.05525kN/m³. Net horizontal force=80.442kN/m, excluding transient seepage. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同底面兩側靜水深5與3m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，淨水平力γ(5²−3²)/2=80.442kN/m；不含滲流動態。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume hydrostatic depths5 and3m above one base and seawaterγ=10.05525kN/m³. Net horizontal force=80.442kN/m, excluding transient seepage.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「潮差與殘留水壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Tidal difference and retained water\", which statement holds?","options":["護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。","全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy.","Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b289-v15-15","title":"潮差與殘留水壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Tidal difference and retained water: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「潮差與殘留水壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tidal difference and retained water” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。以共同底面計算兩側合力並核對相位，另列不能用靜水三角形表達的滲流分量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets. Integrate both sides above a common base and compare timing, separately identifying seepage contributions that cannot be represented by the two static pressure triangles. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。以共同底面計算兩側合力並核對相位，另列不能用靜水三角形表達的滲流分量。","observationEn":"Site practice: Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets. Integrate both sides above a common base and compare timing, separately identifying seepage contributions that cannot be represented by the two static pressure triangles.","failure":"注意干擾：排水堵塞會在外海退潮後保留較高側壓，僅取兩側各自最高水位又可能拼出不存在的工況。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Blocked drains retain lateral pressure after the sea falls, while combining separate maximum levels can create a nonexistent load case. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。以共同底面計算兩側合力並核對相位，另列不能用靜水三角形表達的滲流分量。","textEn":"Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets. Integrate both sides above a common base and compare timing, separately identifying seepage contributions that cannot be represented by the two static pressure triangles.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。以共同底面計算兩側合力並核對相位，另列不能用靜水三角形表達的滲流分量。","textEn":"Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets. Integrate both sides above a common base and compare timing, separately identifying seepage contributions that cannot be represented by the two static pressure triangles.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「潮差與殘留水壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Tidal difference and retained water\"?","options":["同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。"],"optionsEn":["Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步讀取海側潮位及回填孔壓，畫退潮時的水位差歷程，檢查排水出口是否暢通。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Synchronize harbor tide and backfill pressure records, plotting falling-tide lag and checking outlets. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b289-v15-16","title":"潮差與殘留水壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Tidal difference and retained water: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「潮差與殘留水壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tidal difference and retained water” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"排水堵塞會在外海退潮後保留較高側壓，僅取兩側各自最高水位又可能拼出不存在的工況。忽略時間相位，會錯估最不利水平作用及其持續時間。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Blocked drains retain lateral pressure after the sea falls, while combining separate maximum levels can create a nonexistent load case. Ignoring phase misstates both the adverse horizontal action and how long it persists. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設同底面兩側靜水深5與3m、海水γ=10.05525kN/m³，淨水平力γ(5²−3²)/2=80.442kN/m；不含滲流動態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Net horizontal force=80.442kN/m, excluding transient seepage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"排水堵塞會在外海退潮後保留較高側壓，僅取兩側各自最高水位又可能拼出不存在的工況。忽略時間相位，會錯估最不利水平作用及其持續時間。","textEn":"Blocked drains retain lateral pressure after the sea falls, while combining separate maximum levels can create a nonexistent load case. Ignoring phase misstates both the adverse horizontal action and how long it persists.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「潮差與殘留水壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Tidal difference and retained water\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","排水堵塞會在外海退潮後保留較高側壓，僅取兩側各自最高水位又可能拼出不存在的工況。","基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Blocked drains retain lateral pressure after the sea falls, while combining separate maximum levels can create a nonexistent load case.","A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory."],"answer":1,"explanation":"排水堵塞會在外海退潮後保留較高側壓，僅取兩側各自最高水位又可能拼出不存在的工況。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Blocked drains retain lateral pressure after the sea falls, while combining separate maximum levels can create a nonexistent load case. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b289-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「基底偏心壓力」與「船舶靠泊動能」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Eccentric base pressure\" and \"Vessel berthing energy\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b289-v15-17","title":"基底偏心壓力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Eccentric base pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「基底偏心壓力」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Eccentric base pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"沉箱基底反力同時由法向力與力矩決定，平均壓力不足以描述邊緣需求。矩形線彈性全接觸公式還要求地基不出現拉力，若有缺口或基床不平需改變接觸模型；幾何壓力分布也只是作用需求，不能單獨證明現地地基的極限承載力足夠。 假設每米N=3000kN、B=15m、e=1.5m，q=N/B(1±6e/B)，qmax=320kPa、qmin=80kPa，且e\u003cB/6。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「基底偏心壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Normal force and moment jointly determine base reaction, so average pressure misses edge demand. The rectangular linear full-contact formula requires nonnegative contact; gaps or uneven bedding change the model. This geometric pressure distribution describes demand only, not adequate foundation capacity, and must be paired with independent information about ground behavior and actual contact conditions. Assume per-metre N=3000kN,B=15m and e=1.5m. q=N/B(1±6e/B) gives320 and80kPa, with e\u003cB/6. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Eccentric base pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「基底偏心壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Eccentric base pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-17-k1","title":"基底偏心壓力","titleEn":"Eccentric base pressure","text":"沉箱基底反力同時由法向力與力矩決定，平均壓力不足以描述邊緣需求。矩形線彈性全接觸公式還要求地基不出現拉力，若有缺口或基床不平需改變接觸模型；幾何壓力分布也只是作用需求，不能單獨證明現地地基的極限承載力足夠。","textEn":"Normal force and moment jointly determine base reaction, so average pressure misses edge demand. The rectangular linear full-contact formula requires nonnegative contact; gaps or uneven bedding change the model.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「基底偏心壓力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Eccentric base pressure\" is correct?","options":["基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。","靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","沉箱基底反力同時由法向力與力矩決定，平均壓力不足以描述邊緣需求。"],"optionsEn":["A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory.","Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","Normal force and moment jointly determine base reaction, so average pressure misses edge demand."],"answer":2,"explanation":"沉箱基底反力同時由法向力與力矩決定，平均壓力不足以描述邊緣需求。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Normal force and moment jointly determine base reaction, so average pressure misses edge demand. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b289-v15-18","title":"基底偏心壓力：定量估算","titleEn":"Eccentric base pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「基底偏心壓力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Eccentric base pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米N=3000kN、B=15m、e=1.5m，q=N/B(1±6e/B)，qmax=320kPa、qmin=80kPa，且e\u003cB/6。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre N=3000kN,B=15m and e=1.5m. q=N/B(1±6e/B) gives320 and80kPa, with e\u003cB/6. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米N=3000kN、B=15m、e=1.5m，q=N/B(1±6e/B)，qmax=320kPa、qmin=80kPa，且e\u003cB/6。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume per-metre N=3000kN,B=15m and e=1.5m. q=N/B(1±6e/B) gives320 and80kPa, with e\u003cB/6.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「基底偏心壓力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Eccentric base pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。","止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand.","Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b289-v15-19","title":"基底偏心壓力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Eccentric base pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「基底偏心壓力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Eccentric base pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。積分壓力圖回算原合力，再以基床平整、接觸與土體資料檢查全接觸假設，保留局部不適用區域。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs. Integrate the diagram back to the original resultant, then test full contact against bedding, interface and soil evidence, retaining locations where the assumption is unsupported. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。積分壓力圖回算原合力，再以基床平整、接觸與土體資料檢查全接觸假設，保留局部不適用區域。","observationEn":"Site practice: State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs. Integrate the diagram back to the original resultant, then test full contact against bedding, interface and soil evidence, retaining locations where the assumption is unsupported.","failure":"注意干擾：基床局部空洞會集中實際壓力，公式仍畫出平順分布卻不代表真接觸。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A bedding void concentrates real pressure despite a smooth calculated diagram. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。積分壓力圖回算原合力，再以基床平整、接觸與土體資料檢查全接觸假設，保留局部不適用區域。","textEn":"State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs. Integrate the diagram back to the original resultant, then test full contact against bedding, interface and soil evidence, retaining locations where the assumption is unsupported.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。積分壓力圖回算原合力，再以基床平整、接觸與土體資料檢查全接觸假設，保留局部不適用區域。","textEn":"State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs. Integrate the diagram back to the original resultant, then test full contact against bedding, interface and soil evidence, retaining locations where the assumption is unsupported.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「基底偏心壓力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Eccentric base pressure\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。","使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs.","Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"標明法向力是否已扣除揚壓，核對力矩參考點與偏心正負號。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"State whether normal force already excludes uplift and check moment reference and eccentricity signs. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b289-v15-20","title":"基底偏心壓力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Eccentric base pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「基底偏心壓力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Eccentric base pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"基床局部空洞會集中實際壓力，公式仍畫出平順分布卻不代表真接觸。若把尚未扣揚壓的重量當有效法向力，側壓與承載驗算會一起出現不一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A bedding void concentrates real pressure despite a smooth calculated diagram. Treating weight before uplift deduction as effective normal force also creates inconsistent contact and resistance calculations, even if each separate spreadsheet appears internally tidy. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設每米N=3000kN、B=15m、e=1.5m，q=N/B(1±6e/B)，qmax=320kPa、qmin=80kPa，且e\u003cB/6。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume per-metre N=3000kN,B=15m and e=1.5m. q=N/B(1±6e/B) gives320 and80kPa, with e\u003cB/6.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"基床局部空洞會集中實際壓力，公式仍畫出平順分布卻不代表真接觸。若把尚未扣揚壓的重量當有效法向力，側壓與承載驗算會一起出現不一致。","textEn":"A bedding void concentrates real pressure despite a smooth calculated diagram. Treating weight before uplift deduction as effective normal force also creates inconsistent contact and resistance calculations, even if each separate spreadsheet appears internally tidy.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「基底偏心壓力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Eccentric base pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","基床局部空洞會集中實際壓力，公式仍畫出平順分布卻不代表真接觸。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","A bedding void concentrates real pressure despite a smooth calculated diagram."],"answer":2,"explanation":"基床局部空洞會集中實際壓力，公式仍畫出平順分布卻不代表真接觸。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A bedding void concentrates real pressure despite a smooth calculated diagram. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b289-v15-21","title":"船舶靠泊動能：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Vessel berthing energy: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「船舶靠泊動能」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Vessel berthing energy” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"靠泊作用從船舶法向運動能量傳至護舷與碼頭，速度對能量有平方影響。有效質量和偏心等係數需明確定義，不能將排水量直接當任意工況的質量；能量需求也不同於峰值力，必須透過護舷特性及接觸路徑連接兩者。 假設已含附加質量的有效質量20000000kg、法向速0.10m/s、選定合成係數0.80，E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「船舶靠泊動能」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Normal vessel motion transfers energy to fenders and the quay, with velocity entering quadratically. Effective mass and correction factors need explicit definitions rather than treating displacement as the mass for every condition. Energy demand differs from peak force; the fender response and contact path connect them, so one kinetic-energy number cannot alone determine the resulting structural action. Assume effective mass20000000kg already includes added mass, normal speed0.10m/s and selected combined factor0.80. E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ, not an operating limit. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Vessel berthing energy” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「船舶靠泊動能」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Vessel berthing energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-21-k1","title":"船舶靠泊動能","titleEn":"Vessel berthing energy","text":"靠泊作用從船舶法向運動能量傳至護舷與碼頭，速度對能量有平方影響。有效質量和偏心等係數需明確定義，不能將排水量直接當任意工況的質量；能量需求也不同於峰值力，必須透過護舷特性及接觸路徑連接兩者。","textEn":"Normal vessel motion transfers energy to fenders and the quay, with velocity entering quadratically. Effective mass and correction factors need explicit definitions rather than treating displacement as the mass for every condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「船舶靠泊動能」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Vessel berthing energy\" is correct?","options":["靠泊作用從船舶法向運動能量傳至護舷與碼頭，速度對能量有平方影響。","靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。"],"optionsEn":["Normal vessel motion transfers energy to fenders and the quay, with velocity entering quadratically.","Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"靠泊作用從船舶法向運動能量傳至護舷與碼頭，速度對能量有平方影響。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Normal vessel motion transfers energy to fenders and the quay, with velocity entering quadratically. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b289-v15-22","title":"船舶靠泊動能：定量估算","titleEn":"Vessel berthing energy: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「船舶靠泊動能」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Vessel berthing energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設已含附加質量的有效質量20000000kg、法向速0.10m/s、選定合成係數0.80，E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective mass20000000kg already includes added mass, normal speed0.10m/s and selected combined factor0.80. E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ, not an operating limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設已含附加質量的有效質量20000000kg、法向速0.10m/s、選定合成係數0.80，E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective mass20000000kg already includes added mass, normal speed0.10m/s and selected combined factor0.80. E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ, not an operating limit.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「船舶靠泊動能」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Vessel berthing energy\", which statement holds?","options":["全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。"],"optionsEn":["Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b289-v15-23","title":"船舶靠泊動能：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Vessel berthing energy: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「船舶靠泊動能」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Vessel berthing energy” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。用多接觸點和護舷曲線檢查分配，保留船型、潮位與偏心條件，不將算例當操船指令。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact. Review distribution across contact points using fender curves, retaining vessel, tide and eccentricity assumptions without treating the example as vessel-handling instructions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。用多接觸點和護舷曲線檢查分配，保留船型、潮位與偏心條件，不將算例當操船指令。","observationEn":"Site practice: Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact. Review distribution across contact points using fender curves, retaining vessel, tide and eccentricity assumptions without treating the example as vessel-handling instructions.","failure":"注意干擾：把總航速當成法向速度可能高估能量，忽略附加質量或偏心則可能低估特定工況。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using total speed instead of the normal component can overstate energy, while omitted added mass or eccentricity understates particular cases. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。用多接觸點和護舷曲線檢查分配，保留船型、潮位與偏心條件，不將算例當操船指令。","textEn":"Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact. Review distribution across contact points using fender curves, retaining vessel, tide and eccentricity assumptions without treating the example as vessel-handling instructions.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。用多接觸點和護舷曲線檢查分配，保留船型、潮位與偏心條件，不將算例當操船指令。","textEn":"Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact. Review distribution across contact points using fender curves, retaining vessel, tide and eccentricity assumptions without treating the example as vessel-handling instructions.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「船舶靠泊動能」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Vessel berthing energy\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。","列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.","Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact."],"answer":2,"explanation":"列出質量與各修正因子的定義，確定附加質量沒有重複加入，並核對速度是接觸法向分量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Define mass and correction factors, avoiding duplicate added mass, and confirm that velocity is normal to contact. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b289-v15-24","title":"船舶靠泊動能：失效診斷","titleEn":"Vessel berthing energy: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「船舶靠泊動能」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Vessel berthing energy” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把總航速當成法向速度可能高估能量，忽略附加質量或偏心則可能低估特定工況。能量相同的兩種接觸可產生不同峰值力，不能只靠一個數字選結構。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using total speed instead of the normal component can overstate energy, while omitted added mass or eccentricity understates particular cases. Equal-energy contacts can produce different peak forces, so one value does not determine structural demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設已含附加質量的有效質量20000000kg、法向速0.10m/s、選定合成係數0.80，E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: E=0.5Mv²C=80kJ, not an operating limit.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把總航速當成法向速度可能高估能量，忽略附加質量或偏心則可能低估特定工況。能量相同的兩種接觸可產生不同峰值力，不能只靠一個數字選結構。","textEn":"Using total speed instead of the normal component can overstate energy, while omitted added mass or eccentricity understates particular cases. Equal-energy contacts can produce different peak forces, so one value does not determine structural demand.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「船舶靠泊動能」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Vessel berthing energy\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把總航速當成法向速度可能高估能量，忽略附加質量或偏心則可能低估特定工況。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。"],"optionsEn":["Using total speed instead of the normal component can overstate energy, while omitted added mass or eccentricity understates particular cases.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把總航速當成法向速度可能高估能量，忽略附加質量或偏心則可能低估特定工況。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using total speed instead of the normal component can overstate energy, while omitted added mass or eccentricity understates particular cases. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b289-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「護舷曲線積分」與「簡化地震慣性」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Integrating fender response\" and \"Simplified seismic inertia\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b289-v15-25","title":"護舷曲線積分：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Integrating fender response: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「護舷曲線積分」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Integrating fender response” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"護舷吸能是力與變形曲線下面積，不是峰值力直接當能量，材料又可能受溫度、速度及老化影響。線性示意有三角形面積，但實際橡膠護舷曲線常非線性；卸載回彈與耗散也不同，不能把可恢復儲能全部稱為永久吸收。 假設護舷載入反力從0線性增至1000kN、壓縮0.30m，載入功W=Fmaxδ/2=150kJ；卸載耗散未給定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「護舷曲線積分」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Fender work is the area under force versus displacement, not the numerical peak force. Temperature, loading rate and aging affect material response. A linear illustration gives triangular area, but real rubber curves are often nonlinear. Recoverable energy and dissipated energy also differ, so the complete loading work cannot automatically be labeled permanently absorbed impact energy. Assume reaction rises linearly from0 to1000kN over0.30m compression. Loading work is150kJ; unloading dissipation is not specified. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Integrating fender response” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「護舷曲線積分」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Integrating fender response”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-25-k1","title":"護舷曲線積分","titleEn":"Integrating fender response","text":"護舷吸能是力與變形曲線下面積，不是峰值力直接當能量，材料又可能受溫度、速度及老化影響。線性示意有三角形面積，但實際橡膠護舷曲線常非線性；卸載回彈與耗散也不同，不能把可恢復儲能全部稱為永久吸收。","textEn":"Fender work is the area under force versus displacement, not the numerical peak force. Temperature, loading rate and aging affect material response.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「護舷曲線積分」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Integrating fender response\" is correct?","options":["護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。","護舷吸能是力與變形曲線下面積，不是峰值力直接當能量，材料又可能受溫度、速度及老化影響。","加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。"],"optionsEn":["All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy.","Fender work is the area under force versus displacement, not the numerical peak force.","Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand."],"answer":1,"explanation":"護舷吸能是力與變形曲線下面積，不是峰值力直接當能量，材料又可能受溫度、速度及老化影響。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Fender work is the area under force versus displacement, not the numerical peak force. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b289-v15-26","title":"護舷曲線積分：定量估算","titleEn":"Integrating fender response: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「護舷曲線積分」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Integrating fender response” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設護舷載入反力從0線性增至1000kN、壓縮0.30m，載入功W=Fmaxδ/2=150kJ；卸載耗散未給定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume reaction rises linearly from0 to1000kN over0.30m compression. Loading work is150kJ; unloading dissipation is not specified. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設護舷載入反力從0線性增至1000kN、壓縮0.30m，載入功W=Fmaxδ/2=150kJ；卸載耗散未給定。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume reaction rises linearly from0 to1000kN over0.30m compression. Loading work is150kJ; unloading dissipation is not specified.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「護舷曲線積分」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Integrating fender response\", which statement holds?","options":["止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。","使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head.","Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b289-v15-27","title":"護舷曲線積分：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Integrating fender response: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「護舷曲線積分」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Integrating fender response” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。將峰值反力另傳到錨栓和沉箱模型，核對接觸面積與多護舷分擔，避免用吸能值取代力路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units. Transfer peak reaction separately to anchors and caisson, checking contact area and sharing among fenders rather than replacing the force path with an energy rating. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。將峰值反力另傳到錨栓和沉箱模型，核對接觸面積與多護舷分擔，避免用吸能值取代力路徑。","observationEn":"Site practice: Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units. Transfer peak reaction separately to anchors and caisson, checking contact area and sharing among fenders rather than replacing the force path with an energy rating.","failure":"注意干擾：護舷變硬可能在相同位移產生較大峰力，老化裂損也可能改變回彈。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A stiffer fender produces higher reaction at the same displacement, while aging cracks alter recovery. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。將峰值反力另傳到錨栓和沉箱模型，核對接觸面積與多護舷分擔，避免用吸能值取代力路徑。","textEn":"Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units. Transfer peak reaction separately to anchors and caisson, checking contact area and sharing among fenders rather than replacing the force path with an energy rating.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。將峰值反力另傳到錨栓和沉箱模型，核對接觸面積與多護舷分擔，避免用吸能值取代力路徑。","textEn":"Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units. Transfer peak reaction separately to anchors and caisson, checking contact area and sharing among fenders rather than replacing the force path with an energy rating.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「護舷曲線積分」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Integrating fender response\"?","options":["取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。"],"optionsEn":["Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"取得適用溫度與速度下的力變形曲線，積分載入和卸載並檢查量測單位。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Obtain response curves for applicable temperature and rate, integrating loading and unloading with consistent units. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b289-v15-28","title":"護舷曲線積分：失效診斷","titleEn":"Integrating fender response: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「護舷曲線積分」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Integrating fender response” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"護舷變硬可能在相同位移產生較大峰力，老化裂損也可能改變回彈。若只核對標稱吸能而忽略反力曲線，碼頭局部構件可能承受未被納入的需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A stiffer fender produces higher reaction at the same displacement, while aging cracks alter recovery. Checking nominal energy alone and ignoring the reaction curve can leave local quay components exposed to unexamined structural demands. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設護舷載入反力從0線性增至1000kN、壓縮0.30m，載入功W=Fmaxδ/2=150kJ；卸載耗散未給定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Loading work is150kJ; unloading dissipation is not specified.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"護舷變硬可能在相同位移產生較大峰力，老化裂損也可能改變回彈。若只核對標稱吸能而忽略反力曲線，碼頭局部構件可能承受未被納入的需求。","textEn":"A stiffer fender produces higher reaction at the same displacement, while aging cracks alter recovery. Checking nominal energy alone and ignoring the reaction curve can leave local quay components exposed to unexamined structural demands.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「護舷曲線積分」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Integrating fender response\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","護舷變硬可能在相同位移產生較大峰力，老化裂損也可能改變回彈。","加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A stiffer fender produces higher reaction at the same displacement, while aging cracks alter recovery.","Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand."],"answer":1,"explanation":"護舷變硬可能在相同位移產生較大峰力，老化裂損也可能改變回彈。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A stiffer fender produces higher reaction at the same displacement, while aging cracks alter recovery. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b289-v15-29","title":"簡化地震慣性：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Simplified seismic inertia: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「簡化地震慣性」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Simplified seismic inertia” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"沉箱質量在地震中產生慣性作用，但實際反應還包括土水互制、接觸非線性及背填地震土壓。等效靜力示意只能追蹤一個質量的慣性量級，不可被當成完整地震設計；加速度係數必須說明用途，不能直接拿地表峰值代替所有構件反應。 假設每米參與質量300000kg、指定水平加速度0.20g，F=ma=588.6kN/m；僅此質量慣性，不含動水與土壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「簡化地震慣性」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Caisson mass produces seismic inertia, but actual response includes soil-water interaction, nonlinear contact and dynamic backfill action. An equivalent-static illustration tracks one mass contribution only, not complete seismic design. The acceleration coefficient needs an explicit purpose rather than substituting peak ground acceleration directly for the response of every structural component and interacting material domain. Assume participating mass300000kg per metre and selected horizontal acceleration0.20g. F=ma=588.6kN/m includes only this mass inertia, not dynamic soil or water action. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Simplified seismic inertia” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「簡化地震慣性」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Simplified seismic inertia”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-29-k1","title":"簡化地震慣性","titleEn":"Simplified seismic inertia","text":"沉箱質量在地震中產生慣性作用，但實際反應還包括土水互制、接觸非線性及背填地震土壓。等效靜力示意只能追蹤一個質量的慣性量級，不可被當成完整地震設計；加速度係數必須說明用途，不能直接拿地表峰值代替所有構件反應。","textEn":"Caisson mass produces seismic inertia, but actual response includes soil-water interaction, nonlinear contact and dynamic backfill action. An equivalent-static illustration tracks one mass contribution only, not complete seismic design.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「簡化地震慣性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Simplified seismic inertia\" is correct?","options":["加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。","全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。","沉箱質量在地震中產生慣性作用，但實際反應還包括土水互制、接觸非線性及背填地震土壓。"],"optionsEn":["Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand.","Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.","Caisson mass produces seismic inertia, but actual response includes soil-water interaction, nonlinear contact and dynamic backfill action."],"answer":2,"explanation":"沉箱質量在地震中產生慣性作用，但實際反應還包括土水互制、接觸非線性及背填地震土壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Caisson mass produces seismic inertia, but actual response includes soil-water interaction, nonlinear contact and dynamic backfill action. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b289-v15-30","title":"簡化地震慣性：定量估算","titleEn":"Simplified seismic inertia: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「簡化地震慣性」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Simplified seismic inertia” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米參與質量300000kg、指定水平加速度0.20g，F=ma=588.6kN/m；僅此質量慣性，不含動水與土壓。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume participating mass300000kg per metre and selected horizontal acceleration0.20g. F=ma=588.6kN/m includes only this mass inertia, not dynamic soil or water action. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設每米參與質量300000kg、指定水平加速度0.20g，F=ma=588.6kN/m；僅此質量慣性，不含動水與土壓。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume participating mass300000kg per metre and selected horizontal acceleration0.20g. F=ma=588.6kN/m includes only this mass inertia, not dynamic soil or water action.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「簡化地震慣性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Simplified seismic inertia\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。","全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement.","The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b289-v15-31","title":"簡化地震慣性：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Simplified seismic inertia: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「簡化地震慣性」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Simplified seismic inertia” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。另列動水、地基與背填作用，核對相位與組合方式，不將各自峰值任意相加。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input. List water, foundation and backfill dynamics separately, checking phases and combination assumptions instead of arbitrarily adding unrelated peak values into one load case. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。另列動水、地基與背填作用，核對相位與組合方式，不將各自峰值任意相加。","observationEn":"Site practice: Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input. List water, foundation and backfill dynamics separately, checking phases and combination assumptions instead of arbitrarily adding unrelated peak values into one load case.","failure":"注意干擾：只增加沉箱重量可能同時增加慣性需求，不能只看到抗滑增益。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Adding caisson weight can increase inertia as well as sliding resistance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。另列動水、地基與背填作用，核對相位與組合方式，不將各自峰值任意相加。","textEn":"Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input. List water, foundation and backfill dynamics separately, checking phases and combination assumptions instead of arbitrarily adding unrelated peak values into one load case.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。另列動水、地基與背填作用，核對相位與組合方式，不將各自峰值任意相加。","textEn":"Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input. List water, foundation and backfill dynamics separately, checking phases and combination assumptions instead of arbitrarily adding unrelated peak values into one load case.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「簡化地震慣性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Simplified seismic inertia\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。","基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input.","A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在自由體圖標出參與質量與施力位置，說明加速度是合成分析輸入而非現地建議值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Mark participating mass and force location on the free-body diagram and identify acceleration as a synthetic input. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b289-v15-32","title":"簡化地震慣性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Simplified seismic inertia: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「簡化地震慣性」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Simplified seismic inertia” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只增加沉箱重量可能同時增加慣性需求，不能只看到抗滑增益。把土水作用漏掉或重複放入參與質量，都可能令整體地震反應和接觸壓力判讀失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Adding caisson weight can increase inertia as well as sliding resistance. Omitting soil-water action or counting it twice within participating mass can distort the interpreted overall seismic response and the associated distribution of contact pressure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設每米參與質量300000kg、指定水平加速度0.20g，F=ma=588.6kN/m；僅此質量慣性，不含動水與土壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: F=ma=588.6kN/m includes only this mass inertia, not dynamic soil or water action.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「加重沉箱只增加抵抗力而不會增加任何地震慣性需求。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Increasing caisson mass raises resistance without increasing any seismic inertia demand.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只增加沉箱重量可能同時增加慣性需求，不能只看到抗滑增益。把土水作用漏掉或重複放入參與質量，都可能令整體地震反應和接觸壓力判讀失真。","textEn":"Adding caisson weight can increase inertia as well as sliding resistance. Omitting soil-water action or counting it twice within participating mass can distort the interpreted overall seismic response and the associated distribution of contact pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「簡化地震慣性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Simplified seismic inertia\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。","只增加沉箱重量可能同時增加慣性需求，不能只看到抗滑增益。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.","Adding caisson weight can increase inertia as well as sliding resistance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只增加沉箱重量可能同時增加慣性需求，不能只看到抗滑增益。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Adding caisson weight can increase inertia as well as sliding resistance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b289-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「地基壓縮與軌道」與「接縫位移與止水」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Foundation compression and rails\" and \"Joint movement and sealing\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b289-v15-33","title":"地基壓縮與軌道：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Foundation compression and rails: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「地基壓縮與軌道」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Foundation compression and rails” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"碼頭地基沉陷影響岸壁和起重機軌道相對高程，均勻層壓縮只提供總沉陷的一個分量。有效應力增量、受壓層厚與拘束模數需對應同一排水狀態，另有分層和長期固結；服務功能往往由差異沉陷控制，不能只核對平均下沉值。 假設均勻層H=5m、有效應力增量100kPa、拘束模數M=10000kPa，一維s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m；非完整場址預測。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「地基壓縮與軌道」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Foundation settlement changes quay and crane-rail elevations, while uniform layer compression gives only one contribution. Effective stress increment, thickness and constrained modulus must refer to compatible drainage conditions; layering and delayed consolidation add other effects. Serviceability is often controlled by differential movement, so an average settlement alone cannot establish the geometry required by the operational equipment. Assume uniform layer5m,effective stress increment100kPa and constrained modulus10000kPa. One-dimensional s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m, not a complete site prediction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Foundation compression and rails” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「地基壓縮與軌道」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Foundation compression and rails”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-33-k1","title":"地基壓縮與軌道","titleEn":"Foundation compression and rails","text":"碼頭地基沉陷影響岸壁和起重機軌道相對高程，均勻層壓縮只提供總沉陷的一個分量。有效應力增量、受壓層厚與拘束模數需對應同一排水狀態，另有分層和長期固結；服務功能往往由差異沉陷控制，不能只核對平均下沉值。","textEn":"Foundation settlement changes quay and crane-rail elevations, while uniform layer compression gives only one contribution. Effective stress increment, thickness and constrained modulus must refer to compatible drainage conditions; layering and delayed consolidation add other effects.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「地基壓縮與軌道」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Foundation compression and rails\" is correct?","options":["碼頭地基沉陷影響岸壁和起重機軌道相對高程，均勻層壓縮只提供總沉陷的一個分量。","全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。","止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。"],"optionsEn":["Foundation settlement changes quay and crane-rail elevations, while uniform layer compression gives only one contribution.","Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.","Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"碼頭地基沉陷影響岸壁和起重機軌道相對高程，均勻層壓縮只提供總沉陷的一個分量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Foundation settlement changes quay and crane-rail elevations, while uniform layer compression gives only one contribution. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b289-v15-34","title":"地基壓縮與軌道：定量估算","titleEn":"Foundation compression and rails: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「地基壓縮與軌道」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Foundation compression and rails” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設均勻層H=5m、有效應力增量100kPa、拘束模數M=10000kPa，一維s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m；非完整場址預測。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume uniform layer5m,effective stress increment100kPa and constrained modulus10000kPa. One-dimensional s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m, not a complete site prediction. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設均勻層H=5m、有效應力增量100kPa、拘束模數M=10000kPa，一維s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m；非完整場址預測。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume uniform layer5m,effective stress increment100kPa and constrained modulus10000kPa. One-dimensional s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m, not a complete site prediction.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「地基壓縮與軌道」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Foundation compression and rails\", which statement holds?","options":["使用浮重度算出的有效土壓已經包含全部靜水壓力。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","回填內水位總是與外海潮位同步所以不必量測孔壓。"],"optionsEn":["Effective earth pressure calculated with submerged unit weight already includes all hydrostatic pressure.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Backfill water always follows the harbor tide exactly, making pore-pressure measurements unnecessary."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b289-v15-35","title":"地基壓縮與軌道：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Foundation compression and rails: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「地基壓縮與軌道」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Foundation compression and rails” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。沿岸壁和軌道佈設共同基準觀測，分解整體沉陷與差異變形並記錄時間歷程。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity. Observe wall and rails against a common datum, separating overall settlement from differential deformation and retaining their evolution through time rather than only final readings. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。沿岸壁和軌道佈設共同基準觀測，分解整體沉陷與差異變形並記錄時間歷程。","observationEn":"Site practice: Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity. Observe wall and rails against a common datum, separating overall settlement from differential deformation and retaining their evolution through time rather than only final readings.","failure":"注意干擾：同一平均沉陷可能對應完全不同的軌道扭曲，地層厚度沿岸改變會放大局部差異。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Identical mean settlement can accompany very different rail distortion, and varying layer thickness amplifies local differences. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。沿岸壁和軌道佈設共同基準觀測，分解整體沉陷與差異變形並記錄時間歷程。","textEn":"Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity. Observe wall and rails against a common datum, separating overall settlement from differential deformation and retaining their evolution through time rather than only final readings.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。沿岸壁和軌道佈設共同基準觀測，分解整體沉陷與差異變形並記錄時間歷程。","textEn":"Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity. Observe wall and rails against a common datum, separating overall settlement from differential deformation and retaining their evolution through time rather than only final readings.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「地基壓縮與軌道」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Foundation compression and rails\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","靠泊能量增加一倍就表示護舷峰值反力一定增加一倍。","在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Doubling berthing energy necessarily doubles the fender's peak reaction force.","Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在剖面標出受壓層與排水邊界，用試驗說明模數對應應力範圍，核對是否適用線性近似。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Identify compressible layers and drainage boundaries, justifying modulus over the relevant stress range and checking linearity. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b289-v15-36","title":"地基壓縮與軌道：失效診斷","titleEn":"Foundation compression and rails: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「地基壓縮與軌道」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Foundation compression and rails” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"同一平均沉陷可能對應完全不同的軌道扭曲，地層厚度沿岸改變會放大局部差異。把短期量測當最終值，又可能漏掉仍在發展的排水固結。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Identical mean settlement can accompany very different rail distortion, and varying layer thickness amplifies local differences. Treating short-term observations as final movement can also miss consolidation still progressing as excess pore pressure dissipates. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設均勻層H=5m、有效應力增量100kPa、拘束模數M=10000kPa，一維s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m；非完整場址預測。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: One-dimensional s=Δσ′H/M=0.050m, not a complete site prediction.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「全碼頭平均沉陷不大即可保證起重機軌道不會扭曲。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small average quay settlement guarantees that crane rails cannot distort.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"同一平均沉陷可能對應完全不同的軌道扭曲，地層厚度沿岸改變會放大局部差異。把短期量測當最終值，又可能漏掉仍在發展的排水固結。","textEn":"Identical mean settlement can accompany very different rail distortion, and varying layer thickness amplifies local differences. Treating short-term observations as final movement can also miss consolidation still progressing as excess pore pressure dissipates.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「地基壓縮與軌道」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Foundation compression and rails\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["同一平均沉陷可能對應完全不同的軌道扭曲，地層厚度沿岸改變會放大局部差異。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。"],"optionsEn":["Identical mean settlement can accompany very different rail distortion, and varying layer thickness amplifies local differences.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同一平均沉陷可能對應完全不同的軌道扭曲，地層厚度沿岸改變會放大局部差異。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Identical mean settlement can accompany very different rail distortion, and varying layer thickness amplifies local differences. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b289-v15-37","title":"接縫位移與止水：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Joint movement and sealing: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「接縫位移與止水」如何影響大型港口沉箱碼頭的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint movement and sealing” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Large-port caisson quay walls”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相鄰沉箱接縫需要容納溫度、沉陷及水平變位，名義縫寬並不直接代表止水材料可用變形。軸向伸長應變只是幾何量，材料壓縮、剪切和黏結還要靠適用試驗；水密功能亦受水頭和缺陷控制，不能將應變計算當成漏水性能預測。 假設止水材料有效標距500mm、單軸伸長15mm，工程應變ε=15/500=0.030即3%；不含剪切或水密評估。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「接縫位移與止水」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Joints between caissons accommodate temperature, settlement and horizontal movement, but nominal gap width is not the permissible movement of a seal. Axial strain is geometric; compression, shear and adhesion require relevant material tests. Watertightness also depends on head and defects, so a strain calculation cannot predict leakage performance or qualify a joint for all displacement combinations. Assume effective seal gauge length500mm and uniaxial extension15mm. Engineering strainε=0.030=3%, excluding shear and watertightness evaluation. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Joint movement and sealing” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「接縫位移與止水」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Joint movement and sealing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-37-k1","title":"接縫位移與止水","titleEn":"Joint movement and sealing","text":"相鄰沉箱接縫需要容納溫度、沉陷及水平變位，名義縫寬並不直接代表止水材料可用變形。軸向伸長應變只是幾何量，材料壓縮、剪切和黏結還要靠適用試驗；水密功能亦受水頭和缺陷控制，不能將應變計算當成漏水性能預測。","textEn":"Joints between caissons accommodate temperature, settlement and horizontal movement, but nominal gap width is not the permissible movement of a seal. Axial strain is geometric; compression, shear and adhesion require relevant material tests.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「接縫位移與止水」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joint movement and sealing\" is correct?","options":["止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。","相鄰沉箱接縫需要容納溫度、沉陷及水平變位，名義縫寬並不直接代表止水材料可用變形。","所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。"],"optionsEn":["Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head.","Joints between caissons accommodate temperature, settlement and horizontal movement, but nominal gap width is not the permissible movement of a seal.","Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"相鄰沉箱接縫需要容納溫度、沉陷及水平變位，名義縫寬並不直接代表止水材料可用變形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Joints between caissons accommodate temperature, settlement and horizontal movement, but nominal gap width is not the permissible movement of a seal. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b289-v15-38","title":"接縫位移與止水：定量估算","titleEn":"Joint movement and sealing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「接縫位移與止水」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint movement and sealing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設止水材料有效標距500mm、單軸伸長15mm，工程應變ε=15/500=0.030即3%；不含剪切或水密評估。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective seal gauge length500mm and uniaxial extension15mm. Engineering strainε=0.030=3%, excluding shear and watertightness evaluation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設止水材料有效標距500mm、單軸伸長15mm，工程應變ε=15/500=0.030即3%；不含剪切或水密評估。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective seal gauge length500mm and uniaxial extension15mm. Engineering strainε=0.030=3%, excluding shear and watertightness evaluation.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「接縫位移與止水」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joint movement and sealing\", which statement holds?","options":["全場平均堆載可以直接代表貼近岸壁的所有局部輪壓。","基底平均壓力不大就足以證明邊緣接觸與承載都沒有問題。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["The terminal-average surcharge directly represents every concentrated wheel load near the quay edge.","A modest mean base pressure proves that edge contact and foundation capacity are satisfactory.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b289-v15-39","title":"接縫位移與止水：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joint movement and sealing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「接縫位移與止水」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint movement and sealing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。將量測路徑與材料試驗包絡比較，記錄水頭和漏水位置，保留不能由單軸模型代表的組合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together. Compare the observed movement path with material test envelopes, recording head and leakage location and retaining combinations that the uniaxial illustration does not represent. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。將量測路徑與材料試驗包絡比較，記錄水頭和漏水位置，保留不能由單軸模型代表的組合。","observationEn":"Site practice: Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together. Compare the observed movement path with material test envelopes, recording head and leakage location and retaining combinations that the uniaxial illustration does not represent.","failure":"注意干擾：把整條埋入長度當成有效標距會低估局部應變，界面脫黏又可能在材料仍完整時形成水路。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using the entire embedded length as deforming gauge length understates local strain, while debonding creates a water path even with intact material. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。將量測路徑與材料試驗包絡比較，記錄水頭和漏水位置，保留不能由單軸模型代表的組合。","textEn":"Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together. Compare the observed movement path with material test envelopes, recording head and leakage location and retaining combinations that the uniaxial illustration does not represent.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。將量測路徑與材料試驗包絡比較，記錄水頭和漏水位置，保留不能由單軸模型代表的組合。","textEn":"Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together. Compare the observed movement path with material test envelopes, recording head and leakage location and retaining combinations that the uniaxial illustration does not represent.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「接縫位移與止水」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joint movement and sealing\"?","options":["標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","護舷載入曲線下面積全部等於不可恢復的永久耗散能量。"],"optionsEn":["Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","All work under the fender loading curve is irreversibly dissipated energy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"標定止水有效變形段而非任意表面長度，同步量接縫開口、剪切及相對轉角。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Identify the actual deforming gauge length and measure opening, shear and relative rotation together. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b289-v15-40","title":"接縫位移與止水：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joint movement and sealing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"prerequisiteIds":["b289-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「接縫位移與止水」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint movement and sealing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把整條埋入長度當成有效標距會低估局部應變，界面脫黏又可能在材料仍完整時形成水路。只有外觀縫寬資料，無法辨識隱藏的剪切和背面滲漏。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using the entire embedded length as deforming gauge length understates local strain, while debonding creates a water path even with intact material. Visible gap width alone cannot identify hidden shear or leakage behind the joint. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設止水材料有效標距500mm、單軸伸長15mm，工程應變ε=15/500=0.030即3%；不含剪切或水密評估。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Engineering strainε=0.030=3%, excluding shear and watertightness evaluation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「止水材料幾何應變不大就能證明所有水頭下都完全不漏水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small geometric seal strain proves complete watertightness under every water head.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b289-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把整條埋入長度當成有效標距會低估局部應變，界面脫黏又可能在材料仍完整時形成水路。只有外觀縫寬資料，無法辨識隱藏的剪切和背面滲漏。","textEn":"Using the entire embedded length as deforming gauge length understates local strain, while debonding creates a water path even with intact material. Visible gap width alone cannot identify hidden shear or leakage behind the joint.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]},{"id":"b289-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「接縫位移與止水」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joint movement and sealing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把整條埋入長度當成有效標距會低估局部應變，界面脫黏又可能在材料仍完整時形成水路。","所有碼頭背填土都不需牆體變形就會自動達到主動土壓。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Using the entire embedded length as deforming gauge length understates local strain, while debonding creates a water path even with intact material.","Every quay backfill automatically reaches active pressure without any wall movement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把整條埋入長度當成有效標距會低估局部應變，界面脫黏又可能在材料仍完整時形成水路。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using the entire embedded length as deforming gauge length understates local strain, while debonding creates a water path even with intact material. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-pwdm","v15s-tuas-port","v15s-tuas","v15s-tuas-last","v15s-kamaishi"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
